300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l2I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3f28f2a-8b9b-49d9-8536-352e4d4d28c6","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"こうなると対価になるし。","ts":"1624523451.279000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4ng1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f30b9137-e21f-492b-9be3-b70058263ca3","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/voluntas/status/1395957088279359490\u003e","ts":"1624523446.278700","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/voluntas|@voluntas\u003e: Sponsor \u003chttps://twitter.com/tk0miya|@tk0miya\u003e on GitHub Sponsors \u003chttps://github.com/sponsors/tk0miya\u003e Sphinx 開発者のスポンサー月 $500 で Sphinx 関連の相談を気軽にできるようになるので本当にお勧めです。","id":1,"author_name":"V","author_subname":"@voluntas","author_link":"https://twitter.com/voluntas/status/1395957088279359490","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/858198338444836864/OFlImt8f_normal.jpg","text":"Sponsor \u003chttps://twitter.com/tk0miya|@tk0miya\u003e on GitHub Sponsors \u003chttps://github.com/sponsors/tk0miya\u003e Sphinx 開発者のスポンサー月 $500 で Sphinx 関連の相談を気軽にできるようになるので本当にお勧めです。","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1621657080,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/voluntas/status/1395957088279359490","original_url":"https://twitter.com/voluntas/status/1395957088279359490"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zJD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eef5d9c3-c48f-450f-8f22-f40c3ffce03d","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"企業としては寄付は控除対象なのでまぁ、どう考えるか次第だけどお得なんでしょうね。","ts":"1624523418.278500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Fg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"961ce988-301b-4d0c-ade4-76ab1068141e","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"たぶん azu さんの場合は、V さん(時雨堂)から寄付を受けてるからしゃないですかね。","ts":"1624523345.277900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AMT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d49fb73-6850-4f1e-b37b-354fa9b67064","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"企業が GitHub Sponsors として寄付する場合は、支出に対して名目が必要になって税務申告しないといけなくなる。そうしないと「うちはそんなに儲けてないんで税金しはらいませんよ」って事が出来てしまうので。","ts":"1624523230.277100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Akb5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf11fab0-780b-414f-851a-34908b19d46d","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"azu さんが寄付者に対してなにか対価を働いてるのかは僕は知らない。","ts":"1624522768.275600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NL0IX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1bbb838b-9b10-494e-a41c-d5b2951f7be4","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ちなみにこの弁護士ドットコムの一番上の質問は、実際に GitHub Sponsors に関して質問した人の物です。\n\u003chttps://blog.masahiko.info/entry/2020/01/10/160609\u003e","ts":"1624522650.274700","attachments":[{"fallback":"いっしきまさひこBLOG: GitHub Sponsors（オープンソース活動のクラウドファンディング）を始めてみた - いっしきまさひこBLOG","id":1,"title":"GitHub Sponsors（オープンソース活動のクラウドファンディング）を始めてみた - いっしきまさひこBLOG","title_link":"https://blog.masahiko.info/entry/2020/01/10/160609","text":"2019年5月14日から、GitHub Sponsors（GitHubスポンサー）という機能がGitHubで利用可能です。 ・GitHub Sponsorsの公式サイトはこちら（下の図） GitHub Sponsorsの公式ページ（キャプチャして引用） GitHub Sponsorsはいわば、コードをオープンソースで書く人を金銭的に支援するための機能です。イメージ的には、Kickstarterなどのクラウドファンディングのように、気に入ったプロジェクトや人、活動を金銭的に支援して、活動の成功を見守り、対価（リターン）として何らかのサービスを教授できるサービスです。 オープンソース活動の場合の対…","image_url":"https://cdn-ak.f.st-hatena.com/images/fotolife/m/misshiki/20200110/20200110155029.png","blocks":null,"ts":1578639969,"service_name":"いっしきまさひこBLOG","service_icon":"https://blog.masahiko.info/icon/touch","from_url":"https://blog.masahiko.info/entry/2020/01/10/160609","original_url":"https://blog.masahiko.info/entry/2020/01/10/160609"}],"edited":{"user":"U03C6TEAZ","ts":"1624523065.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"azLqN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"63e4a3bb-8c8b-4b6a-a3b6-535dbcead781","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ここがめんどくさい。","ts":"1624522561.273800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=UZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b9a6a355-5f7a-44d3-9613-43e5927d6dcb","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ただ寄付だとしても企業から貰うと話が変わる。","ts":"1624522549.273600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OxX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"94030058-73d4-4b11-ba23-2383cb31bbd1","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"そうすね。","ts":"1624522486.273300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FMj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2E2D99D6-CCA4-4B4C-B6C3-C81FA71EF97E","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"特にモノを渡すと商品購入になってしまう可能性もあるので余計にややこしくなる（消費税とかね","ts":"1624522472.273000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=lK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b4e1e69-2181-4143-b22d-540626670da6","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"自分もサイトに名前載っけますくらい","ts":"1624522461.272600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=ZZg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"783aabdf-e2a7-4ba1-93fc-3a43a524572e","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"そういうのもあって僕は当初から特典はありませんと伝えてたり。","ts":"1624522445.271800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AXW0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"18C1EB15-D105-4783-A050-63E39ADFAAE0","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"ですね。何か見返りがあると、役務提供の対価と見做されてしまう可能性がありますからね。","ts":"1624522405.270600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qc4n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b55eec17-5c0e-4d40-97ff-2a732ee59263","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"さすがに弁護士ドットコムに書いてある内容なのでそんなに間違ってないと思うけど。","ts":"1624522376.270000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BdhRj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a68e60c0-ad5c-4236-a127-8a9ca065b0bd","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"GitHub Sponsors に対してなにか見返りをする予定であればそれは寄付じゃなくなるかもしれない。","ts":"1624522348.269300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qLq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"893ae2f4-fc39-4939-a74f-571c4f3567d6","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"見返りはないので寄付ですね。","ts":"1624522306.267600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"au/VJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"743ee9c8-a68d-4edd-a63b-36fb6f0343b9","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://www.bengo4.com/c_1015/c_1878/c_1880/b_879579/\u003e","ts":"1624522294.267100","attachments":[{"fallback":"弁護士ドットコム: ソフトウェア開発者への金銭的支援と、資金決済法について","id":1,"title":"ソフトウェア開発者への金銭的支援と、資金決済法について","title_link":"https://www.bengo4.com/c_1015/c_1878/c_1880/b_879579/","text":"ネット上の海外サイトに「ソフトウェア開発者が第三者から金銭的支援してもらえる機能」があり、それを利用したいと考えています。金銭支援の見返りとして、例えば「毎月100円なら支援者側ページに『支援中を...","image_url":"https://www.bengo4.com/img/citizen/common/bengo4-ogp.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"弁護士ドットコム","service_icon":"https://www.bengo4.com/img/sp/apple-touch-icon.png","from_url":"https://www.bengo4.com/c_1015/c_1878/c_1880/b_879579/","original_url":"https://www.bengo4.com/c_1015/c_1878/c_1880/b_879579/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6XW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"61A73473-0864-404C-BD59-E3C016515C90","type":"mess