8f6834","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"そういえば先週新しいのが来てたんだった\n\u003chttps://comic-walker.com/contents/detail/KDCW_MF01202187010000_68/\u003e","ts":"1624514296.252700","attachments":[{"fallback":"ComicWalker - 人気マンガが無料で読める！: FX戦士くるみちゃん","id":1,"title":"FX戦士くるみちゃん","title_link":"https://comic-walker.com/contents/detail/KDCW_MF01202187010000_68/","image_url":"https://static.comic-walker.com/uploadimage/og/KDCW_MF01202187010000_68.png?20210624","blocks":null,"service_name":"ComicWalker - 人気マンガが無料で読める！","service_icon":"https://static.comic-walker.com/pc/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://comic-walker.com/contents/detail/KDCW_MF01202187010000_68/","original_url":"https://comic-walker.com/contents/detail/KDCW_MF01202187010000_68/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C5Vz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"684a2b5e-fea3-4f0c-bb43-a8b6bf365d1e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/TransferWise\u003e\nなるほど、たぶん大手銀行はなるべくこうなるように調整はしつつ、でも手数料他はどうしたって出るだろうからその分なんだろうな...","ts":"1624514008.251800","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: TransferWise","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"TransferWise","title_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/TransferWise","text":"TransferWise（トランスファーワイズ）は、2011年1月にクリスト・カーマン (Kristo Käärmann) とターヴェット・ヒンリクス (Taavet Hinrikus) が創業したP2P送金サービスである。\nロンドンが本拠地で、ニューヨーク、シドニー、シンガポール、エストニアなど8箇所に事務所を構える。伝統的な国際送金とは異なり、利用者のマッチングを図ることで少額のコミッションによる送金を可能にしている。両替はインターバンクレートで行われ、為替手数料は発生しない。2018年には純利益が800万ドルに達し 400万人を超える顧客が一月当たり約40億ドルの送金をしている。\n750以上の送金ルートに対応をしており、マルチカレンシー口座サービスも提供している。","image_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/TransferWise_peer-to-peer_money_transfer.png","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/TransferWise","original_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/TransferWise"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0EY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a8ee098d-4eea-43a6-a010-8a6057dfed73","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"WiseとRevolutはなんか知ってそうな気がしますが…。特に後者は最近ちょっとだけ話題になってますし。","ts":"1624513286.251000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rxFC3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"feb11d3f-4682-41e2-b026-801d2d7e7344","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"FX?","ts":"1624512882.250000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M6Mm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e08b92d1-9700-41c4-84bc-c96d2d8b59a9","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"いいタイミングで生活費の変換せなあかん、はなかなか大変そう","ts":"1624512863.249800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FM3mj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c1e88d5d-2f49-432e-b7a4-9f0b01f42843","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"発行手数料がなかなか高いですが、デビットカードを発行すればATMからも出金できるようになりますし。","ts":"1624512612.249100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IXhP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f2386b4a-7fa8-476e-b0f6-f5c518763703","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"為替が絡むならTransferWiseを噛ませるとコストが下がるかもですね。","ts":"1624512490.248300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ba6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"14ef250c-5a35-4342-ba60-7fdb4b7a1750","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"円安になるともらえるお金が増えますね","ts":"1624512381.247700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q52"}]},{"client_msg_id":"50e8b8df-812c-4626-b804-10baf27c310a","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"github sponsorsの場合はドルでもらって、それが円に変換されるから","ts":"1624512371.247400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_